151	    /* Does the passed-in method body represent a native function?  If
152	     * so, return the corresponding native action.
153	     * Otherwise, return null.
154	     *
155	     * Right now this does a naive pattern-match for the expression:
156	     *
157	     * builtinPrimitive("name.of.java.class.as.literal.String")
158	     *
159	     * Using Java reflection we load and construct an instance of this
160	     * class, failing somewhat-gracefully if any part of the attempt
161	     * fails.  The error checking is gratuitously detailed so the
162	     * library hacker can sort out what is going on when things break.
163	     */
164	    public static Applicable checkAndLoadNative(Applicable defn, boolean isFunctionalMethod) {
165	        return checkAndLoadNative(defn, isFunctionalMethod, null);
166	    }
